        "d": "A special selection of foot moving cuts, delays and versions from across the West Indies and those who carried the sound further.\nCurated to keep feet moving on soundsystems both big and small, Inna Riddim showcases an ongoing exploration of the reggae diaspora, from the lowest of low ends to quickfire patois toasters, all with the dancehall in mind.\nMade to play loud with enough space to move.",
